    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21402" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ignĭpŏtens</span></b> ,
		entis, adj.
		ignis-potens, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>potent in fire</i>, <i>ruler of
			fire</i>, <i>ignipotent</i>, a <b>poet.</b> epithet of Vulcan (Vergilian): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">deus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 12, 90</span></i>
			.—Also as <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ignĭpŏ-tens</span></b> 
			= Vulcan, <i><span class="en">id. ib. 8, 414</span></i>; 423; 628;
			710; 10, 243.</div>
